        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[guide]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_pOLe" id="directory-tree">Directory tree<a href="https://elajep.github.io/blog/server#directory-tree" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Directory tree" title="Direct link to Directory tree" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-txt codeBlockContainer_HlJm theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_GasO"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-txt codeBlock_EsE8 thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_eOhz"><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">📁 /home/USER/docker/          &lt;-- (Sul disco interno veloce del Mini PC)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">├── 📁 dockge/</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│   ├── 📁 data/              &lt;-- (Qui Dockge salva le sue impostazioni)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│   └── 📁 stacks/            &lt;-- ( file di testo delle tue "ricette")</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">├── 📁 jellyfin/</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│   ├── 📁 config/            &lt;-- (Database, impostazioni, chi ha visto cosa)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│   └── 📁 cache/             &lt;-- (Locandine e file  di transcodifica)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">└── 📁 ersatztv/</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    └── 📁 config/            &lt;-- (Palinsesti, loghi dei canali, impostazioni)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">💾 /media/USER/Server/plex/    &lt;-- (Il tuo disco esterno USB)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">│</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">├── 📁 film/                  &lt;-- (I tuoi famosi mattoni in H.265)</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">└── 📁 series/</span><br></div></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Sistema il BIOS !!!!</p>
<p>Fai attenzione al partizionamento disco</p>]]></content>
